seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"88293","synopsis":"大学生の静歌は友達に誘われて、街コンに参加することに。雰囲気になじめずにいた静歌に声をかけてくれたのは、超絶美人なお姉さん・涼だった。一緒に会場を抜け出して打ち解けるけど、急にキスされ押し倒されてしまう。しかも、女の子の体にはない感触が…まさかこの人、女装…！？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fjHxAvnGuAsfnNioNaP59TPCYtc.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"88294","synopsis":"涼との一件が頭から離れない静歌。思い悩んでいると、大学に女装姿の涼が押しかけてくる。友達の前では「女」として振る舞う涼に、静歌は戸惑うばかり。そして強引にトイレで二人きりにさせられて…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g4xIonifR3ainYvoTBJhW2Zrcdr.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"88296","synopsis":"涼に振り回されっぱなしの静歌は、もう自分に関わらないように言おうと決意する。しかし、会いに行って出てきた涼は、女装ではなく素顔の「男」の姿だった。パニックになった静歌は、涼に流されて連れ出されてしまい…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xsQqjMYkqs1tztvNvFlAWrLQcIt.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"88295","synopsis":"遊びのつもりで手を出すのはやめてほしいと、涼に伝える静歌。しかし、涼は「遊びじゃない」と真剣な顔で返してくる。涼の気持ちがわからずに静歌がひとりで悩んでいると、チャラい男たちが近づいてきて…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o2S0BOwbvpWMq1QDm9THhZZXL4r.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"88298","synopsis":"涼のファンから逃げてホテルに入った二人。静歌は涼に言われた「好き」という言葉にうろたえてしまう。身勝手さを詫びながらも涼は思いを伝えてくるが、静歌は自分の気持ちがわからなくて…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/svLi3nYm5w65FBLc2b4aQct9RvJ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88297","synopsis":"静歌の「彼氏候補」になった涼は早速静歌をデートに誘い、遊園地に行くことに。しかし、自分に自信が持てない静歌は、涼の好意を素直に受け止められない。涼は浮かない顔の静歌と観覧車に乗り込んで…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hmVAgeljgIw6QIUGfvjKI2NFRjG.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"88300","synopsis":"雨宿りのために観覧車に乗った二人は、冷えた体をいたわり合う。くっついて温まりながら、静歌に優しく気持ちを伝える涼。まっすぐな言葉に思わずドキドキしていると、涼が「キスしていい？」と聞いてきて…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l12Th1qZUfcx72BCBio9uaGzSPR.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"88299","synopsis":"静歌は涼と一緒に過ごすうちに、だんだんと涼のことを意識し始めていることに気づく。感じたことのない気持ちに戸惑った静歌は、観覧車を降りた後に涼を呼び止めると…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6ubnLwAtDwfvluv6gusUkpRvvEx.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"88301","synopsis":"ふとしたおしゃべりの中で涼に「手料理を食べてみたい」と言われた静歌は、思い切って手作りのお菓子を渡しに行く。静歌からのプレゼントに大喜びしてはしゃぐ涼。照れた静歌はお菓子を膝の上に落としてしまい…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7kgLU97RwTwbnupZBYSe2d8tZFS.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"88302","synopsis":"涼が授業を受けている間、静歌は大学構内を散歩することに。そこで出会った桜井が、涼とお似合いだと噂されていることを知る。涼と桜井が話している姿を見た静歌は、急に胸が苦しくなって…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aXuUeIR50bLV7sry3w4cfopudrm.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"88303","synopsis":"ヤキモチを焼いて、涼を突き放してしまった静歌。その上、倉谷から好意を打ち明けられて戸惑ってしまう。静歌はありのままの気持ちで答えるが、その会話を聞いていた涼は静歌の言葉を誤解してしまい…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1kEVwnG1pNEupQNPYSBzrfcwGtb.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13